- Page with a loader: `src/pages/people/index.tsx` and `src/pages/people/index.server.ts`
- Page with a loader and action: `src/pages/people/add.tsx` and `src/pages/people/add.server.ts`
- Client mutation: `src/components/people/person-detail/relationships-section.tsx`
- Form pattern: `src/components/people/add-person-form.tsx`
- Root layout: `src/pages/layout.tsx`

## Avoid

- Don't add a client-side routing library or a client query cache — Void pages and their loaders own routing and data
- Don't hand-roll a fetch URL or call `window.fetch` for app data — use `void/client` so the RouteMap types and the SSR in-process path stay intact
- Don't import a server module into a page or component to read data — go through `/api`
- Don't use CSS modules or styled-components — use Tailwind utilities
- Don't install a global state library
- Don't import from barrel files — import directly from the component or module file
- Don't add boolean props to customize component behavior — use composition instead
- Don't use `forwardRef` — pass refs directly as props (React 19)
